WEBVTT

00:00:00.320 --> 00:00:05.400


00:00:06.625 --> 00:00:08.091
(OUTRUN BROTHERS PICTURES)

00:00:14.182 --> 00:00:16.851
(Seo Ji Hye)

00:00:22.190 --> 00:00:24.325
(Go Soo)

00:00:31.099 --> 00:00:33.434
(Kim Jae Kyung)

00:00:38.539 --> 00:00:40.842
(Yoon Je Moon)

00:00:43.292 --> 00:00:45.893
(Written and Directed by Im Geon Jung)

00:00:47.489 --> 00:00:51.078
(REVERSE)

00:00:55.156 --> 00:00:55.990
(This drama is a work of fiction.)

00:00:55.990 --> 00:00:57.025
(All characters, organizations,
and events in this drama are fictitious.)

00:00:57.025 --> 00:00:57.859
(This drama complied
with production guidelines...)

00:00:57.859 --> 00:00:58.693
(for filming child actors and animals.)

00:01:39.667 --> 00:01:40.501
This is insane.

00:01:41.803 --> 00:01:42.737
Everyone's insane.

00:02:04.792 --> 00:02:06.761
Why is it so loud?

00:02:28.650 --> 00:02:29.484
Hee Su.

00:02:29.851 --> 00:02:30.685
Hee Su.

00:03:32.847 --> 00:03:35.750
(Accident)

00:03:44.592 --> 00:03:45.426
We have an emergency patient.

00:03:45.426 --> 00:03:47.128
She was conscious when she was rescued,

00:03:47.128 --> 00:03:48.863
but lost consciousness again
on the way here.

00:03:48.863 --> 00:03:50.131
Let's get her to the operating room now.

00:03:50.398 --> 00:03:51.966
- Call the surgeon on duty.
- Yes, Doctor.

00:03:51.966 --> 00:03:53.067
(Operating Center)

00:04:01.009 --> 00:04:03.177
Ma'am, can you hear me?

00:04:03.544 --> 00:04:04.479
Can you hear me?

00:04:12.587 --> 00:04:13.321
Sorry?

00:04:29.437 --> 00:04:32.407
(3 days after the accident)

00:04:44.852 --> 00:04:47.155
Myo Jin, wake up.

00:04:50.959 --> 00:04:52.026
Can you hear me?

00:04:54.629 --> 00:04:56.364
Jun Ho.

00:04:57.932 --> 00:04:58.666
Yes?

00:04:59.801 --> 00:05:00.835
Ryu...

00:05:03.171 --> 00:05:04.505
Jun Ho.

00:05:05.273 --> 00:05:06.107
Yeah.

00:05:07.976 --> 00:05:08.810
It's me.

00:05:09.677 --> 00:05:10.945
Ryu Jun Ho.

00:05:19.320 --> 00:05:20.254
Myo Jin.

00:05:51.619 --> 00:05:52.687
You bastard.

00:06:17.378 --> 00:06:20.315
(5 days after the accident)

00:06:27.221 --> 00:06:28.122
You're awake.

00:06:31.492 --> 00:06:33.361
How do you feel? Are you okay?

00:06:34.829 --> 00:06:36.264
Where...

00:06:37.932 --> 00:06:38.967
am I?

00:06:43.972 --> 00:06:45.306
You're in the hospital.

00:06:46.808 --> 00:06:48.943
You got hurt in an accident,
so you were admitted.

00:06:50.545 --> 00:06:53.982
You're probably
having trouble moving right now.

00:06:55.016 --> 00:06:56.184
An accident?

00:06:57.285 --> 00:06:58.119
Luckily,

00:06:59.921 --> 00:07:01.723
you're past the worst of it.

00:07:01.723 --> 00:07:02.724
They said...

00:07:03.024 --> 00:07:05.526
you pulled through
because you're strong and healthy.

00:07:07.395 --> 00:07:08.463
Myo Jin.

00:07:11.132 --> 00:07:11.966
Is that...

00:07:13.301 --> 00:07:14.736
my name?

00:07:15.937 --> 00:07:16.771
Yeah.

00:07:17.405 --> 00:07:18.273
Myo Jin.

00:07:19.207 --> 00:07:20.408
Ham Myo Jin.

00:07:21.709 --> 00:07:22.644
My fiancée.

00:07:27.115 --> 00:07:28.383
We're engaged.

00:07:31.052 --> 00:07:31.919
Do you remember?

00:07:33.588 --> 00:07:34.922
I don't remember...

00:07:36.691 --> 00:07:37.859
anything.

00:07:39.994 --> 00:07:40.828
It's okay.

00:07:41.529 --> 00:07:43.965
Yeah, that's perfectly normal right now.

00:07:44.799 --> 00:07:46.434
But it'll all slowly come back.

00:08:09.724 --> 00:08:11.426
Are you going...

00:08:11.426 --> 00:08:13.962
to keep standing there
like you're being punished?

00:08:16.531 --> 00:08:17.799
I like the view.

00:08:19.667 --> 00:08:20.802
For a Hwangryong orchid,

00:08:21.669 --> 00:08:23.504
you only water it once a week.

00:08:32.547 --> 00:08:33.381
Have a seat.

00:08:41.055 --> 00:08:41.856
Did you know?

00:08:42.957 --> 00:08:44.425
You've got this strange way...

00:08:45.460 --> 00:08:47.629
of drawing people's attention.

00:08:48.863 --> 00:08:50.732
With social media and all,

00:08:50.732 --> 00:08:53.434
isn't everyone desperate
for attention these days?

00:08:54.335 --> 00:08:55.169
But...

00:08:56.304 --> 00:08:58.139
you don't seem to need that.

00:09:00.408 --> 00:09:01.509
You're too kind.

00:09:02.277 --> 00:09:03.077
But...

00:09:03.911 --> 00:09:06.180
I like you for another reason.

00:09:06.881 --> 00:09:08.082
Do you know what it is?

00:09:08.483 --> 00:09:10.118
No, but I'd like to.

00:09:10.118 --> 00:09:11.185
Please tell me.

00:09:12.153 --> 00:09:13.721
Because I can feel your ambition.

00:09:16.257 --> 00:09:17.792
Any real man...

00:09:19.460 --> 00:09:22.263
ought to carry a sharp blade in here...

00:09:22.263 --> 00:09:23.231
like you.

00:09:25.333 --> 00:09:26.634
Pride and dignity,

00:09:27.035 --> 00:09:28.403
who gives a damn about that?

00:09:29.570 --> 00:09:30.471
Right?

00:09:35.076 --> 00:09:36.644
It's a real shame...

00:09:37.545 --> 00:09:38.680
Chairman Choi died like that.

00:09:39.948 --> 00:09:41.549
He was still in his prime.

00:09:44.652 --> 00:09:46.888
It must be hard on you too.

00:09:58.466 --> 00:10:01.736
This is the list of judges
finalized yesterday.

00:10:02.270 --> 00:10:03.104
Thank you.

00:10:03.905 --> 00:10:05.873
Now that it's in my hands,

00:10:05.873 --> 00:10:08.109
it reaching someone else's hands...

00:10:08.109 --> 00:10:10.144
is only a matter of time.

00:10:10.578 --> 00:10:13.648
How you clear a path is up to you.

00:10:15.283 --> 00:10:16.317
I'll remember that.

00:10:17.685 --> 00:10:21.623
I wondered how to repay
what I owed Chairman Choi,

00:10:23.925 --> 00:10:25.026
so make it count.

00:10:33.234 --> 00:10:35.903
(List of Judges
for the Museum Competition Released)

00:10:45.680 --> 00:10:47.715
I knew the lineup would be strong,

00:10:48.650 --> 00:10:49.951
but this is completely unexpected.

00:10:51.953 --> 00:10:54.956
Once people hear
CEO Oh Sang Il is judging,

00:10:54.956 --> 00:10:56.858
nobody's going to sleep easily.

00:10:57.659 --> 00:10:59.360
Me included, of course.

00:11:00.161 --> 00:11:01.562
CEO Oh Sang Il?

00:11:02.764 --> 00:11:03.631
Yes.

00:11:04.098 --> 00:11:06.267
He's known for being incredibly rigid,

00:11:08.102 --> 00:11:10.405
so he doesn't usually do things like this.

00:11:11.205 --> 00:11:12.874
The International Federation
of Architects...

00:11:13.441 --> 00:11:15.510
hails him as the only person in Asia...

00:11:15.510 --> 00:11:16.778
who inspires them.

00:11:20.782 --> 00:11:22.083
I'll take you to the hospital.

00:11:22.817 --> 00:11:25.286
How is she feeling?

00:11:27.288 --> 00:11:28.656
The other injuries...

00:11:29.657 --> 00:11:31.526
seem to be healing well, but...

00:11:34.395 --> 00:11:38.232
I'd like to ask about my guardian,

00:11:38.232 --> 00:11:39.167
Ryu Jun Ho.

00:11:39.968 --> 00:11:41.869
They say he's the man I love.

00:11:41.869 --> 00:11:42.570
(30 days after the accident)

00:11:42.570 --> 00:11:44.205
But I can't remember him at all.

00:11:45.306 --> 00:11:46.941
Even after such a terrible accident,

00:11:46.941 --> 00:11:49.744
how can I not remember
the man I was engaged to?

00:11:50.244 --> 00:11:52.747
Is it frustrating
because your memories with Ryu Jun Ho...

00:11:52.747 --> 00:11:53.781
won't come back?

00:11:54.916 --> 00:11:58.052
It feels more like emotion.

00:11:59.354 --> 00:12:02.423
I know how much he worries about me
and how good he is to me,

00:12:03.024 --> 00:12:04.759
but I don't feel anything.

00:12:05.526 --> 00:12:07.261
My emotions feel distant.

00:12:08.129 --> 00:12:09.697
Since when have you felt that way?

00:12:11.232 --> 00:12:13.434
Ever since I woke up,

00:12:14.002 --> 00:12:15.737
it's felt the same.

00:12:17.338 --> 00:12:20.041
I tried to think
about what it was like before,

00:12:21.676 --> 00:12:23.344
but nothing comes to mind.

00:12:24.812 --> 00:12:26.748
Why am I like this?

00:12:29.017 --> 00:12:31.619
(Hanguk Somang Hospital)

00:12:45.366 --> 00:12:46.434
I have good news.

00:12:47.568 --> 00:12:48.436
What is it?

00:12:49.804 --> 00:12:50.638
This.

00:12:52.740 --> 00:12:54.642
They said you won't need it next week.

00:12:57.412 --> 00:12:59.380
I heard I'd need it longer.

00:13:01.482 --> 00:13:02.583
They said...

00:13:03.251 --> 00:13:06.120
your recovery is twice as fast
as everyone else's.

00:13:07.021 --> 00:13:07.922
I see.

00:13:11.926 --> 00:13:12.794
Thank you.

00:13:14.996 --> 00:13:15.830
For what?

00:13:16.264 --> 00:13:18.433
If anything had happened to you,

00:13:18.433 --> 00:13:19.300
I really would've...

00:13:21.436 --> 00:13:22.837
It's thanks to you, Jun Ho.

00:13:23.371 --> 00:13:24.238
Thank you.

00:13:28.343 --> 00:13:31.112
Episodic memory loss?

00:13:31.579 --> 00:13:34.716
It's when the brain
creates a defense mechanism...

00:13:34.716 --> 00:13:36.718
against anxiety.

00:13:37.318 --> 00:13:39.153
It happens unconsciously...

00:13:39.153 --> 00:13:41.356
regardless of the person's will,

00:13:41.856 --> 00:13:44.492
and it's often seen
in people who've suffered...

00:13:44.492 --> 00:13:45.793
severe trauma.

00:13:46.661 --> 00:13:48.830
It seems...

00:13:49.998 --> 00:13:52.567
she still can't remember me clearly.

00:13:53.034 --> 00:13:53.801
Yes.

00:13:54.602 --> 00:13:55.770
Ms. Ham still feels...

00:13:56.604 --> 00:13:59.741
even you are a stranger.

00:14:00.541 --> 00:14:04.879
But it's already been a month
since treatment began.

00:14:05.713 --> 00:14:07.315
The fact...

00:14:07.315 --> 00:14:09.817
that she still can't clearly remember
even the man she's engaged to,

00:14:10.685 --> 00:14:14.422
isn't that very serious?

00:14:14.422 --> 00:14:15.189
No.

00:14:15.189 --> 00:14:16.724
Right now, to Ms. Ham,

00:14:16.724 --> 00:14:19.093
everyone around her
feels exactly the same.

00:14:19.360 --> 00:14:21.863
That's how severe the shock was.

00:14:21.863 --> 00:14:23.631
She sees me every day...

00:14:23.998 --> 00:14:25.800
and talks to me every day.

00:14:26.601 --> 00:14:27.502
How could she...

00:14:28.136 --> 00:14:30.438
feel the same about me
as she does about everyone else?

00:14:32.707 --> 00:14:35.643
Is that even possible?

00:14:48.489 --> 00:14:49.657
(Complete bed rest)

00:14:56.931 --> 00:14:58.099
According to the accident report,

00:14:58.566 --> 00:15:01.202
Ms. Ham was driving alone before dawn...

00:15:01.202 --> 00:15:03.171
when the car rolled over.

00:15:04.806 --> 00:15:06.708
No matter how strong someone is,

00:15:06.708 --> 00:15:10.578
the fear of death in that situation
must have been overwhelming.

00:15:11.980 --> 00:15:13.114
Just hang in there.

00:15:14.816 --> 00:15:16.017
Everything will be okay.

00:16:11.406 --> 00:16:13.308
Is this really all you've got?

00:16:13.308 --> 00:16:15.143
Shut up, you murdering bastard.

00:16:24.752 --> 00:16:26.387
Come on, give me more.

00:16:38.766 --> 00:16:39.600
Kill me.

00:16:42.637 --> 00:16:43.972
If you don't kill me today,

00:16:44.572 --> 00:16:45.640
then you're the one who dies...

00:16:46.474 --> 00:16:47.675
by my hand.

00:16:49.777 --> 00:16:52.747
How did you end up like this?

00:16:54.015 --> 00:16:54.983
Give up.

00:16:55.283 --> 00:16:56.851
You're beyond saving.

00:16:57.185 --> 00:16:59.053
Stop wasting your time.

00:16:59.053 --> 00:17:00.188
Are you done barking?

00:17:18.339 --> 00:17:19.240
Are you okay?

00:17:21.376 --> 00:17:22.210
Yes.

00:17:23.044 --> 00:17:23.978
Do you want some water?

00:17:25.713 --> 00:17:26.648
No.

00:17:35.423 --> 00:17:36.357
How does it feel?

00:17:37.191 --> 00:17:38.126
How does what feel?

00:17:38.493 --> 00:17:39.360
Finally,

00:17:40.428 --> 00:17:42.797
you're getting out
of this miserable hospital.

00:17:45.600 --> 00:17:47.035
No more patient gowns.

00:17:48.002 --> 00:17:50.238
You can wear clothes
that actually suit you.

00:18:13.962 --> 00:18:15.396
This must be a tricky one for you.

00:18:23.404 --> 00:18:24.806
This won't do.

00:18:25.473 --> 00:18:27.275
I need to rebuild the gallery.

00:18:28.610 --> 00:18:29.477
All of a sudden?

00:18:29.711 --> 00:18:31.446
I gave the exterior a vintage look,

00:18:31.446 --> 00:18:33.081
and trendy work won't come in now.

00:18:33.748 --> 00:18:35.116
People are judging it in advance.

00:18:36.117 --> 00:18:37.151
It has to change...

00:18:38.019 --> 00:18:39.153
starting with my own ideas.

00:18:40.088 --> 00:18:41.289
Do you have something in mind?

00:18:41.990 --> 00:18:45.059
Installation art and pop art are hot
in Korea right now.

00:18:45.660 --> 00:18:47.228
More people are majoring in them too.

00:18:48.529 --> 00:18:49.998
The gallery should change with that.

00:18:54.335 --> 00:18:55.370
But what brings you here?

00:18:55.637 --> 00:18:57.138
CEO Ryu is always busy.

00:18:59.641 --> 00:19:00.808
The museum competition.

00:19:01.542 --> 00:19:02.477
You've heard about it, right?

00:19:02.677 --> 00:19:03.511
Yeah.

00:19:04.312 --> 00:19:05.713
It looked pretty big.

00:19:06.147 --> 00:19:08.082
People are going to pull strings
with the assemblyman.

00:19:08.082 --> 00:19:10.818
Anyone who knows
he has clout at the ministry.

00:19:11.019 --> 00:19:13.254
Dad hasn't said anything yet.

00:19:13.921 --> 00:19:16.291
Why? Are you entering too?

00:19:16.858 --> 00:19:19.527
For an architect like me,
it's a dream stage...

00:19:20.295 --> 00:19:21.462
I cannot give up on.

00:19:23.298 --> 00:19:25.633
It's not about credentials or background,

00:19:26.701 --> 00:19:27.835
and definitely not money.

00:19:29.003 --> 00:19:30.505
So what's the real reason?

00:19:32.941 --> 00:19:35.777
It's like you turning down countless
offers from major corporations...

00:19:35.777 --> 00:19:38.646
and sitting here questioning who you are.

00:19:38.646 --> 00:19:39.514
Of course,

00:19:39.514 --> 00:19:42.517
it doesn't compare to the depth of insight
of a four-term assemblyman's daughter.

00:19:43.251 --> 00:19:44.452
Cut the jokes.

00:19:45.420 --> 00:19:46.554
What is it, then?

00:19:47.288 --> 00:19:48.323
A declaration.

00:19:50.825 --> 00:19:53.995
A declaration to step out
from Mono Group's shadow?

00:19:55.363 --> 00:19:56.464
Is that too grand?

00:19:57.665 --> 00:19:59.634
Then I just need to swat away the flies.

00:20:02.603 --> 00:20:05.106
(Hanguk Somang Hospital)

00:20:07.775 --> 00:20:10.645
(60 days after the accident)

00:20:13.648 --> 00:20:14.882
Nice weather, isn't it?

00:20:14.882 --> 00:20:16.184
You're finally being discharged.

00:20:16.517 --> 00:20:17.518
How do you feel?

00:20:18.386 --> 00:20:19.420
I'm fine.

00:20:19.621 --> 00:20:21.923
Is there anything
that's still especially uncomfortable?

00:20:22.557 --> 00:20:23.658
No.

00:20:23.658 --> 00:20:24.759
Everything's fine.

00:20:26.060 --> 00:20:26.928
Myo Jin.

00:20:28.162 --> 00:20:29.530
You're here.

00:20:29.530 --> 00:20:31.299
You've worked hard.

00:20:31.833 --> 00:20:35.036
Not me.
Myo Jin's the one who really suffered.

00:20:35.837 --> 00:20:37.705
Myo Jin, you've been through a lot.

00:20:42.844 --> 00:20:44.512
(Cognitive Function Test Record,
Ham Myo Jin)

00:20:44.512 --> 00:20:47.582
We've run cognitive tests over time,

00:20:48.249 --> 00:20:52.020
and you have severe impairment
in your pre-accident memories, Ms. Ham.

00:20:52.587 --> 00:20:55.089
Even after discharge,
you need to focus on treatment.

00:20:55.723 --> 00:20:56.758
Understood.

00:20:58.326 --> 00:21:01.763
Then what kind of effort
should she make day to day...

00:21:01.763 --> 00:21:03.431
to help her recovery?

00:21:03.731 --> 00:21:06.768
Get in the habit
of taking notes or making recordings.

00:21:06.768 --> 00:21:09.570
Sometimes, memories
can surface unexpectedly.

00:21:09.971 --> 00:21:11.072
When that happens,

00:21:11.072 --> 00:21:13.341
just accept them as they are.

00:21:13.975 --> 00:21:16.044
Even if they seem irrelevant now,

00:21:16.577 --> 00:21:18.980
they may be part of an important memory.

00:21:19.514 --> 00:21:22.617
Should I record them
every day, like a diary?

00:21:23.151 --> 00:21:25.653
Any method is fine,

00:21:25.653 --> 00:21:28.356
but it's best to act on it
as soon as possible.

00:21:41.669 --> 00:21:42.503
Myo Jin.

00:21:43.771 --> 00:21:44.872
Look behind you.

00:21:57.118 --> 00:21:58.119
Congratulations on your discharge.

00:21:59.687 --> 00:22:02.523
You have no idea how long I've waited...

00:22:02.523 --> 00:22:03.891
for this moment.

00:22:08.930 --> 00:22:09.998
Freesia.

00:22:10.498 --> 00:22:12.100
Right, freesia.

00:22:14.936 --> 00:22:16.337
Do you know what freesias mean?

00:22:19.674 --> 00:22:20.775
A new beginning.

00:22:21.976 --> 00:22:24.512
Here's to your new beginning.

00:22:25.713 --> 00:22:26.781
Thank you.

00:22:32.720 --> 00:22:35.089
I can remember flower names like this,

00:22:36.491 --> 00:22:38.660
so why can't I remember you, Jun Ho?

00:22:40.728 --> 00:22:41.729
Hello.

00:22:42.196 --> 00:22:45.099
I'm Ryu Jun Ho, Ham Myo Jin's fiancé.

00:22:45.533 --> 00:22:46.534
Nice to meet you.

00:22:51.406 --> 00:22:52.707
You can forget everything.

00:22:53.374 --> 00:22:55.243
I'm remembering it all for you.

00:22:56.477 --> 00:22:59.747
I'll keep filling it in
as much as you need.

00:23:00.348 --> 00:23:01.182
But...

00:23:02.250 --> 00:23:04.085
I'll fill you only with memories of me,

00:23:04.085 --> 00:23:05.420
and just ignore everything else.

00:23:49.063 --> 00:23:50.565
My room is across the hall.

00:23:51.099 --> 00:23:52.734
That'll be more comfortable
for a while, right?

00:23:54.369 --> 00:23:55.136
What?

00:23:57.071 --> 00:23:59.140
At the hospital,
I fell asleep beside you...

00:23:59.941 --> 00:24:01.676
and ended up with bruises
around my eyes a few times.

00:24:21.095 --> 00:24:22.096
Even now,

00:24:23.097 --> 00:24:26.067
minimalist designs are still in style.

00:24:26.734 --> 00:24:29.203
At a glance, they all look alike
because of the size,

00:24:29.203 --> 00:24:30.605
but if you look closely,
they're all different.

00:24:31.606 --> 00:24:34.809
They use wood or metal as materials...

00:24:35.443 --> 00:24:37.512
to show each one's character.

00:24:40.081 --> 00:24:42.050
They're very clean on their own,

00:24:42.050 --> 00:24:42.884
but...

00:24:44.018 --> 00:24:45.320
whether they really suit this place...

00:24:49.891 --> 00:24:50.692
Why?

00:24:53.528 --> 00:24:56.397
It just feels real now
that you're an architect, Jun Ho.

00:24:58.099 --> 00:25:00.635
Was I talking about something too boring?

00:25:00.635 --> 00:25:01.803
No.

00:25:02.737 --> 00:25:05.873
Then did you design
your house too, Jun Ho?

00:25:08.676 --> 00:25:09.577
Ours.

00:25:11.179 --> 00:25:12.013
Our house.

00:25:16.718 --> 00:25:18.152
Our house.

00:25:44.545 --> 00:25:47.215
Let's get you better soon
and go abroad too.

00:25:48.149 --> 00:25:49.584
I think that'd lift your spirits.

00:25:50.551 --> 00:25:51.352
Okay.

00:25:51.953 --> 00:25:53.921
Start thinking about
where you want to go...

00:25:53.921 --> 00:25:55.189
so I can prepare in advance.

00:25:56.658 --> 00:25:57.692
Prepare what?

00:25:58.026 --> 00:25:59.761
You've never been abroad...

00:26:00.194 --> 00:26:01.429
so you don't have a passport.

00:26:03.631 --> 00:26:04.632
I see.

00:26:09.003 --> 00:26:10.805
Myo Jin, can you pass me that bottle?

00:26:12.073 --> 00:26:13.441
I want to get rid of the meat smell.

00:26:14.776 --> 00:26:15.677
Here.

00:26:25.053 --> 00:26:25.787
Myo Jin.

00:26:26.654 --> 00:26:28.256
Myo Jin, are you okay?

00:26:30.325 --> 00:26:32.527
There was someone in the fire.

00:26:35.163 --> 00:26:36.164
Jun Ho.

00:26:37.365 --> 00:26:39.067
What happened to me?

00:26:42.904 --> 00:26:44.939
Any memory is fine.

00:26:44.939 --> 00:26:46.574
Just say whatever comes to you.

00:26:47.141 --> 00:26:49.310
A special anniversary or memory.

00:26:50.311 --> 00:26:52.513
Something you cherished.

00:26:53.481 --> 00:26:55.350
Someone you miss terribly,

00:26:55.350 --> 00:26:56.451
or...

00:26:56.451 --> 00:26:58.386
someone you never want to see again.

00:27:00.688 --> 00:27:01.623
A man.

00:27:03.992 --> 00:27:06.828
He's saying something loudly.

00:27:07.362 --> 00:27:09.597
Can you tell me...

00:27:09.597 --> 00:27:10.865
where you are?

00:27:13.301 --> 00:27:16.204
I don't know where it is.

00:27:17.238 --> 00:27:19.674
How do you feel there right now?

00:27:20.341 --> 00:27:22.110
I'm trapped.

00:27:23.645 --> 00:27:26.047
I want to get out, but I can't.

00:27:28.816 --> 00:27:31.619
It feels like I'm being dragged somewhere.

00:27:32.053 --> 00:27:33.388
Why does it feel that way?

00:27:33.955 --> 00:27:36.524
I feel like I did something wrong.

00:27:46.301 --> 00:27:47.135
Here.

00:27:59.013 --> 00:28:00.281
Would you take a look at this?

00:28:04.919 --> 00:28:06.454
The accident you experienced...

00:28:06.454 --> 00:28:08.356
is classified as an episodic memory.

00:28:08.990 --> 00:28:12.093
Anyone can lose memories after a shock.

00:28:12.727 --> 00:28:15.663
What you lost isn't the memory itself.

00:28:15.663 --> 00:28:18.633
The part that lets you retrieve it
was injured.

00:29:27.568 --> 00:29:28.736
Someone collapsed!

00:29:30.405 --> 00:29:31.439
Hey.

00:29:31.439 --> 00:29:32.507
- Hey, are you okay?
- Are you okay?

00:29:32.941 --> 00:29:34.442
Stay with us.

00:29:34.442 --> 00:29:35.276
Hey!

00:29:35.777 --> 00:29:37.345
This young guy...

00:29:41.416 --> 00:29:43.351
Boss, what did I tell you?

00:29:44.118 --> 00:29:45.787
I said she wouldn't die that easily.

00:29:46.821 --> 00:29:48.022
Now that she's out of the hospital,

00:29:48.022 --> 00:29:50.024
it's only a matter of time
before she comes looking for you.

00:29:51.426 --> 00:29:52.527
What are you going to do?

00:29:55.163 --> 00:29:58.766
Please stop being so stubborn
and listen to me.

00:30:09.477 --> 00:30:12.080
(Medicine)

00:30:41.309 --> 00:30:43.244
What are you so calm about?

00:30:44.279 --> 00:30:45.446
Boss,

00:30:45.913 --> 00:30:48.216
you don't think this is over, do you?

00:30:48.983 --> 00:30:50.585
"They've done all they can."

00:30:50.585 --> 00:30:52.453
"So maybe they won't do
anything else now."

00:30:53.154 --> 00:30:55.723
The moment you think that,
you'll get hit the same way again.

00:31:16.611 --> 00:31:17.912
Do you remember that flower's name too?

00:31:18.680 --> 00:31:20.381
You made that yourself, Myo Jin.

00:31:22.483 --> 00:31:23.318
I did?

00:31:24.285 --> 00:31:25.219
When?

00:31:26.854 --> 00:31:28.189
I'm not sure.

00:31:29.357 --> 00:31:31.059
Judging by how faded the color is,

00:31:31.626 --> 00:31:32.994
it must be old.

00:31:40.301 --> 00:31:42.203
Here, it's a new phone.

00:31:44.539 --> 00:31:45.807
I'm number one in it,

00:31:46.140 --> 00:31:47.308
so call me anytime.

00:31:49.110 --> 00:31:49.944
Okay.

00:31:55.883 --> 00:31:57.285
I know this is frustrating.

00:31:58.286 --> 00:32:00.688
It feels like
things will never get better, right?

00:32:01.789 --> 00:32:02.757
But they will.

00:32:03.324 --> 00:32:04.559
You'll get better soon.

00:32:05.727 --> 00:32:07.895
It won't be as hard
as it was in the hospital.

00:32:08.896 --> 00:32:10.264
I'll make sure of that.

00:32:23.745 --> 00:32:24.646
I'm sorry.

00:32:26.080 --> 00:32:27.248
It's okay.

00:32:27.248 --> 00:32:28.683
You're busy. Don't push yourself.

00:32:30.285 --> 00:32:32.654
I got everything ready
so we could go biking together.

00:32:34.188 --> 00:32:35.156
How about this weekend?

00:32:36.324 --> 00:32:37.392
Since it's been a while,

00:32:37.392 --> 00:32:39.527
I think I'd rather go out by myself.

00:32:41.929 --> 00:32:42.897
Are you sure about that?

00:32:43.331 --> 00:32:44.265
Why?

00:32:44.832 --> 00:32:46.668
You think I won't be able
to find my way home?

00:33:17.165 --> 00:33:19.233
What? She looks perfectly fine.

00:33:36.718 --> 00:33:38.820
I'm always by your side, Myo Jin.

00:33:39.754 --> 00:33:41.322
Whenever you look at this ring,

00:33:43.458 --> 00:33:45.126
I want you to think of me.

00:33:52.734 --> 00:33:53.501
Hey.

00:33:54.902 --> 00:33:55.703
Let go!

00:33:56.104 --> 00:33:58.172
Let go! Let go of my bag!

00:34:12.487 --> 00:34:13.421
Are you crazy?

00:34:14.088 --> 00:34:15.189
You little...

00:34:26.367 --> 00:34:27.302
Dang.

00:34:27.969 --> 00:34:28.836
Hey.

00:34:29.771 --> 00:34:31.239
- Unbelievable.
- Hey.

00:34:31.239 --> 00:34:33.241
You hit the jackpot.

00:34:33.241 --> 00:34:34.409
Don't touch it.

00:34:34.809 --> 00:34:35.910
Drinks are on me today.

00:34:42.817 --> 00:34:43.584
Hey.

00:34:43.918 --> 00:34:44.719
Hey.

00:34:44.719 --> 00:34:46.220
Just play your game, you punk.

00:34:46.220 --> 00:34:47.655
Look over there, idiot.

00:34:48.022 --> 00:34:48.890
Hey, over there.

00:34:50.024 --> 00:34:50.858
Hey.

00:35:16.618 --> 00:35:17.518
Architecture...

00:35:18.319 --> 00:35:21.856
begins when two bricks
are carefully put together.

00:35:22.957 --> 00:35:24.926
That's how it begins.

00:35:26.794 --> 00:35:28.463
At last year's Copenhagen conference,

00:35:28.463 --> 00:35:30.331
that's the line Mr. Oh quoted.

00:35:30.865 --> 00:35:32.533
That's exactly how I feel right now.

00:35:33.334 --> 00:35:36.070
Don't tell me you've memorized
Mr. Oh's whole speech from that day.

00:35:37.238 --> 00:35:38.506
How much time do we have?

00:35:38.506 --> 00:35:40.908
I secured 30 minutes before your lecture.

00:35:40.908 --> 00:35:41.943
Then let's finish within that.

00:35:42.277 --> 00:35:43.311
That's enough.

00:35:43.311 --> 00:35:45.179
A man like Mr. Oh...

00:35:45.179 --> 00:35:47.215
wouldn't spend too long...

00:35:47.215 --> 00:35:48.816
talking to someone he'd just met like me.

00:35:49.917 --> 00:35:50.885
(Myo Jin)

00:35:51.786 --> 00:35:52.687
Myo Jin.

00:35:52.687 --> 00:35:53.655
Sorry, but I'm in the middle of...

00:35:57.158 --> 00:35:58.960
How many times is this now?

00:36:00.094 --> 00:36:01.763
(Police Station)

00:36:02.230 --> 00:36:03.131
Myo Jin.

00:36:04.966 --> 00:36:05.833
Are you okay?

00:36:07.502 --> 00:36:08.369
Are you?

00:36:10.071 --> 00:36:11.873
That didn't happen
from riding a bike, did it?

00:36:18.112 --> 00:36:19.580
Are you Ham Myo Jin's guardian?

00:36:20.615 --> 00:36:21.449
Was it you?

00:36:22.183 --> 00:36:23.351
Did you do that to this woman?

00:36:23.351 --> 00:36:24.319
Calm down.

00:36:24.319 --> 00:36:25.553
- Jun Ho.
- Please calm down.

00:36:25.887 --> 00:36:27.622
Damn it, this is so irritating.

00:36:28.089 --> 00:36:30.391
- You little punk.
- You can't do this in here.

00:36:30.758 --> 00:36:31.559
Hey.

00:36:32.193 --> 00:36:34.495
I don't care if he's a minor.
I'm not letting him off.

00:36:34.862 --> 00:36:36.064
Handle it according to the law.

00:36:38.900 --> 00:36:39.901
Myo Jin, are you okay?

00:36:39.901 --> 00:36:41.602
Move.

00:36:45.373 --> 00:36:47.241
Why are you following someone
who killed a person?

00:36:47.241 --> 00:36:48.543
Do you want to get killed too?

00:37:08.229 --> 00:37:10.231
Did I kill someone?

00:37:11.532 --> 00:37:12.500
What?

00:37:12.500 --> 00:37:14.535
What that boy's mother said earlier...

00:37:16.537 --> 00:37:18.640
didn't sound like
she was just saying things.

00:37:19.440 --> 00:37:22.343
She's the kind of person
who slaps her kid in public.

00:37:23.511 --> 00:37:25.513
Why do you care
what someone like that says?

00:37:26.281 --> 00:37:28.783
Even if I keep seeing
someone burning to death,

00:37:30.251 --> 00:37:32.587
even if people around here
say I killed someone,

00:37:33.921 --> 00:37:35.957
am I supposed to think it's nothing?

00:37:38.693 --> 00:37:40.595
That's not what I meant.

00:37:40.895 --> 00:37:42.664
That's what the doctor said too.

00:37:43.765 --> 00:37:45.300
Any memory that comes up,

00:37:45.300 --> 00:37:46.934
I should accept as it is.

00:37:49.537 --> 00:37:51.439
But that doesn't mean
you have to believe...

00:37:51.439 --> 00:37:52.774
every cruel thing a stranger says.

00:37:53.408 --> 00:37:54.809
Then what am I supposed to believe?

00:37:55.576 --> 00:37:58.146
Did the hospital even tell us
how to tell what to trust?

00:37:58.479 --> 00:38:00.114
This is a time to be careful.

00:38:01.249 --> 00:38:02.183
Don't...

00:38:03.017 --> 00:38:04.519
overinterpret everything.

00:38:10.658 --> 00:38:11.793
Hey, he's here.

00:38:11.793 --> 00:38:12.827
He's here.

00:38:12.827 --> 00:38:14.262
Come on, over here.

00:38:14.262 --> 00:38:15.196
Right here.

00:38:16.064 --> 00:38:17.665
Pull over here.

00:38:19.467 --> 00:38:21.069
- Hurry up.
- Hurry up.

00:38:21.069 --> 00:38:23.004
- Hurry up.
- Hurry up.

00:38:24.472 --> 00:38:25.873
Hurry up.

00:38:25.873 --> 00:38:27.008
(L Karaoke Bar)

00:38:39.454 --> 00:38:41.122
Boss, we're all set.

00:38:41.522 --> 00:38:42.357
Okay.

00:38:49.330 --> 00:38:50.331
Damn it.

00:38:50.331 --> 00:38:51.499
That scared me.

00:38:51.499 --> 00:38:52.734
What was that?

00:38:53.534 --> 00:38:55.837
Gentlemen, we're closed.

00:38:56.104 --> 00:38:58.106
We need to get off work too
if we want to work again tomorrow.

00:38:58.606 --> 00:39:00.875
What is all this?

00:39:00.875 --> 00:39:03.144
We just had rice wine
and scallion pancakes at a bar.

00:39:03.945 --> 00:39:05.146
We got suckered.

00:39:05.146 --> 00:39:06.114
Suckered how?

00:39:06.547 --> 00:39:10.184
That place earlier drugged our drinks.

00:39:10.184 --> 00:39:11.119
What?

00:39:12.720 --> 00:39:14.022
You're way too suspicious.

00:39:16.591 --> 00:39:17.692
Let's see.

00:39:17.692 --> 00:39:20.194
- Room charge, band fee,
- What?

00:39:24.198 --> 00:39:26.267
and this too, so it's 3,000 per person.

00:39:26.634 --> 00:39:27.669
So 12,000 dollars.

00:39:28.503 --> 00:39:30.038
Time to settle up, gentlemen.

00:39:30.038 --> 00:39:32.707
I even took off the hostess fee
so it wouldn't be too much.

00:39:32.707 --> 00:39:33.975
What the...

00:39:33.975 --> 00:39:35.476
Are you screwing around right now?

00:39:35.476 --> 00:39:38.246
Hey, don't get tangled up.
Just call the police.

00:39:38.246 --> 00:39:39.447
- Yeah, call them.
- Yeah.

00:39:41.149 --> 00:39:41.983
Why?

00:39:42.684 --> 00:39:44.819
- Do you have your phone?
- My phone?

00:39:45.920 --> 00:39:46.788
Hey, look.

00:39:48.556 --> 00:39:50.591
Once you're done paying,
I'll send you each one...

00:39:50.591 --> 00:39:51.559
as a little souvenir.

00:39:56.831 --> 00:39:57.665
Hey.

00:39:58.900 --> 00:39:59.968
Do you want to die?

00:40:01.836 --> 00:40:03.104
Give me my phone right now.

00:40:05.073 --> 00:40:06.341
- Hey.
- Yeah?

00:40:06.341 --> 00:40:07.675
Should we flip this whole place over?

00:40:08.343 --> 00:40:11.179
Young Gu, let's have some fun!

00:40:13.448 --> 00:40:14.349
What?

00:40:15.249 --> 00:40:17.685
Are you paying or not, gentlemen?

00:40:21.856 --> 00:40:22.890
Young Gu, three minutes.

00:40:22.890 --> 00:40:24.092
Yes, boss.

00:40:32.934 --> 00:40:34.335
Hey, you punk!

00:40:35.637 --> 00:40:37.405
Hey!

00:40:50.218 --> 00:40:51.286
You bastard.

00:41:01.796 --> 00:41:03.231
Damn it.

00:41:04.265 --> 00:41:05.633
I'm in charge of the VIPs!

00:41:11.839 --> 00:41:13.942
That felt good there.

00:41:13.942 --> 00:41:15.076
Yeah, the big one.

00:41:15.543 --> 00:41:17.078
It's so big, I love it.

00:41:17.378 --> 00:41:18.146
Hey.

00:41:18.947 --> 00:41:19.814
Do you know me?

00:41:20.581 --> 00:41:22.250
Why are you staring at me?

00:41:22.250 --> 00:41:23.518
Because it's nice.

00:41:24.852 --> 00:41:27.221
Your lady is absolutely gorgeous.

00:41:27.855 --> 00:41:30.525
If you've got nothing better to do,
go home and sleep it off.

00:41:30.758 --> 00:41:31.726
Yes, sir.

00:41:31.726 --> 00:41:32.694
Damn it.

00:41:33.161 --> 00:41:34.262
Let's go.

00:41:34.762 --> 00:41:37.398
You two look great together.

00:41:37.398 --> 00:41:38.900
Let go of me. Are you crazy?

00:41:38.900 --> 00:41:40.702
Babe, calm down.

00:41:40.702 --> 00:41:42.036
She's completely insane.

00:41:42.036 --> 00:41:42.870
Seriously.

00:41:45.640 --> 00:41:47.675
Babe, who is she?

00:41:48.276 --> 00:41:49.711
Do you know that woman?

00:41:49.711 --> 00:41:51.779
How would I know her?

00:41:51.779 --> 00:41:52.780
You saw her too, didn't you?

00:41:52.981 --> 00:41:55.350
Why are you snapping at me?

00:41:55.984 --> 00:41:58.152
You should've listened to me.

00:41:58.152 --> 00:41:59.821
About what?

00:41:59.821 --> 00:42:01.689
I said we should go
to my studio apartment, didn't I?

00:42:01.990 --> 00:42:03.725
We didn't, and look what happened.

00:42:03.725 --> 00:42:05.927
That studio apartment is way too small.

00:42:05.927 --> 00:42:08.563
Then get me a bigger place.

00:42:08.563 --> 00:42:10.898
Fine. I'll buy you an apartment.

00:42:10.898 --> 00:42:11.866
Really?

00:42:12.266 --> 00:42:13.301
Yeah.

00:42:16.371 --> 00:42:17.205
What's this?

00:42:17.205 --> 00:42:19.641
(Unread Message)

00:42:20.241 --> 00:42:22.010
The photos came out great, didn't they?

00:42:22.010 --> 00:42:23.278
What is this?

00:42:51.139 --> 00:42:53.408
I was trying to let you sleep longer,

00:42:54.042 --> 00:42:55.810
but I ended up waking you instead.

00:42:57.412 --> 00:42:58.446
It's okay.

00:42:59.681 --> 00:43:00.848
Did you take your medicine
before sleeping?

00:43:01.549 --> 00:43:02.383
Yes.

00:43:03.985 --> 00:43:05.620
But when I take it,

00:43:05.954 --> 00:43:07.555
I get into a bad mood.

00:43:08.756 --> 00:43:10.358
I have nightmares,

00:43:11.225 --> 00:43:12.894
and they feel too real.

00:43:13.361 --> 00:43:14.195
Really?

00:43:15.530 --> 00:43:17.899
That's odd. It was prescribed properly.

00:43:18.232 --> 00:43:20.735
Okay, I'll call the hospital and ask.

00:43:35.450 --> 00:43:36.884
The detectives are here.

00:43:37.385 --> 00:43:39.887
They say they have questions
about your accident.

00:43:41.623 --> 00:43:43.625
I'm Detective Woo Jong Rok
from Namyeong Police Station.

00:43:43.625 --> 00:43:44.726
I'm Detective Lee Seong Tae.

00:43:48.730 --> 00:43:50.064
- Please sit down.
- Okay.

00:44:01.709 --> 00:44:03.578
She hasn't been out of the hospital
for very long,

00:44:03.578 --> 00:44:05.213
and she's still recovering.

00:44:05.213 --> 00:44:08.483
So please keep this brief.

00:44:08.716 --> 00:44:09.550
Okay.

00:44:10.351 --> 00:44:13.488
We heard from the hospital
about Ms. Ham's condition.

00:44:13.488 --> 00:44:16.624
So we'd just like to confirm a few things.

00:44:18.259 --> 00:44:19.294
The hospital?

00:44:19.727 --> 00:44:20.628
Yes.

00:44:20.628 --> 00:44:23.831
From the surgeon who handled
all of your surgeries...

00:44:23.831 --> 00:44:24.832
and treatment.

00:44:27.902 --> 00:44:28.736
I see.

00:44:29.904 --> 00:44:32.840
About the accident that happened
on Jebudo Island that day,

00:44:32.840 --> 00:44:34.142
could you tell us about it?

00:44:34.776 --> 00:44:36.144
Do you remember anything now?

00:44:38.579 --> 00:44:40.248
I still...

00:44:41.115 --> 00:44:42.650
Detective,

00:44:42.650 --> 00:44:44.485
that's a very broad question.

00:44:46.621 --> 00:44:49.223
You can just say
whatever comes to mind.

00:44:50.391 --> 00:44:53.928
If it's something from the villa
or around there,

00:44:53.928 --> 00:44:54.796
anything at all.

00:44:57.465 --> 00:44:58.900
The villa...

00:44:59.901 --> 00:45:01.636
Before dawn that day,

00:45:01.636 --> 00:45:03.104
where were you headed?

00:45:13.648 --> 00:45:14.816
Right now,

00:45:15.717 --> 00:45:16.684
my memory...

00:45:17.785 --> 00:45:21.055
Are you saying you still
don't remember the accident at all?

00:45:23.925 --> 00:45:25.293
I'm sorry.

00:45:25.293 --> 00:45:26.828
I guess I'm still not myself yet.

00:45:27.495 --> 00:45:28.429
Detective,

00:45:28.730 --> 00:45:31.866
if you're only here
to establish the basic facts...

00:45:32.567 --> 00:45:33.501
Wait.

00:45:37.605 --> 00:45:38.673
Could it be...

00:45:40.108 --> 00:45:43.378
that I caused some kind of accident there?

00:45:43.845 --> 00:45:45.413
There was an explosion
caused by a gas leak,

00:45:45.413 --> 00:45:47.248
and at the time the villa caught fire,

00:45:47.815 --> 00:45:50.585
your car overturned in an accident.

00:45:51.653 --> 00:45:53.721
The time and distance were too close...

00:45:54.555 --> 00:45:56.858
to treat them as separate incidents.

00:45:57.625 --> 00:45:58.459
What?

00:46:01.262 --> 00:46:02.230
Detective,

00:46:02.230 --> 00:46:04.232
if what you're saying is true,

00:46:04.232 --> 00:46:06.367
are you saying...

00:46:07.101 --> 00:46:08.903
she is a suspect in that case?

00:46:09.304 --> 00:46:11.739
Even a driver passing by
the accident scene...

00:46:12.307 --> 00:46:14.475
said they saw Ms. Ham's car...

00:46:14.475 --> 00:46:16.477
coming from the villa.

00:46:22.250 --> 00:46:23.351
Myo Jin, are you okay?

00:46:26.154 --> 00:46:27.956
Didn't the doctor say
not to agitate the patient?

00:46:27.956 --> 00:46:29.123
Didn't they tell you?

00:46:29.123 --> 00:46:31.793
Why do you have to do this here and now?

00:46:32.293 --> 00:46:33.394
Please leave immediately.

00:46:37.131 --> 00:46:38.299
We apologize.

00:46:39.200 --> 00:46:40.068
Ms. Ham,

00:46:40.368 --> 00:46:41.869
we hope you recover soon.

00:46:42.737 --> 00:46:43.538
Bye.

00:46:49.477 --> 00:46:50.812
Myo Jin, are you okay?

00:47:01.255 --> 00:47:02.857
This isn't some kids' game.

00:47:02.857 --> 00:47:04.158
She doesn't remember? I can't even.

00:47:05.593 --> 00:47:09.263
What if Ham Myo Jin's condition
is worse than we thought?

00:47:09.263 --> 00:47:11.933
Give me a break.

00:47:12.433 --> 00:47:13.935
How long has it been since the accident?

00:47:14.636 --> 00:47:16.170
Then why did they discharge her?

00:47:24.445 --> 00:47:25.680
I don't like this.

00:47:26.681 --> 00:47:27.949
Ham Myo Jin's accident.

00:47:27.949 --> 00:47:29.617
Go over every forensic record again.

00:47:29.617 --> 00:47:31.886
There isn't a single piece
of evidence left.

00:47:32.520 --> 00:47:33.788
I told you.

00:47:33.788 --> 00:47:35.623
They never found the car's dashcam either.

00:47:37.025 --> 00:47:39.494
What about anything attached to her body,
like clothes or shoes?

00:47:40.194 --> 00:47:42.430
They were badly damaged
during emergency treatment,

00:47:42.430 --> 00:47:43.731
so everything was disposed of.

00:47:45.333 --> 00:47:47.969
Then what am I supposed to do?

00:47:47.969 --> 00:47:48.970
Why did the chief take...

00:47:48.970 --> 00:47:50.505
a case like this?

00:47:50.505 --> 00:47:52.240
Do you think he wanted to?

00:47:52.240 --> 00:47:54.142
Team One suddenly just dropped it,

00:47:54.142 --> 00:47:55.410
so we had to take it on.

00:48:00.915 --> 00:48:01.983
Here's one.

00:48:03.318 --> 00:48:04.686
Why is even this messing with me now?

00:48:05.019 --> 00:48:07.755
You sure know how to sniff things out.

00:48:08.790 --> 00:48:09.824
What did you say?

00:48:09.824 --> 00:48:10.725
Sir.

00:48:12.126 --> 00:48:14.629
You dug up quite a bit.

00:48:20.935 --> 00:48:21.903
Settlement agreement.

00:48:23.938 --> 00:48:25.039
What is this?

00:48:25.707 --> 00:48:27.875
We settled everything yesterday
for 30,000 dollars.

00:48:27.875 --> 00:48:30.178
A settlement only becomes valid...

00:48:30.178 --> 00:48:32.213
after the money is transferred,

00:48:32.213 --> 00:48:33.314
right?

00:48:33.948 --> 00:48:35.783
- But...
- Hold on.

00:48:44.926 --> 00:48:46.961
And on top of that,
you met again yesterday too...

00:48:46.961 --> 00:48:49.097
at W Wine Bar in Cheongdam-dong.

00:48:50.131 --> 00:48:51.933
Very impressive.

00:48:52.767 --> 00:48:55.203
I can see you're very professional.

00:48:55.203 --> 00:48:57.272
I'm impressed too...

00:48:57.272 --> 00:48:58.773
at the tireless sex drive...

00:48:58.773 --> 00:49:00.908
that keeps me going.

00:49:01.609 --> 00:49:02.644
What's the secret to it?

00:49:03.278 --> 00:49:04.279
An affair?

00:49:05.580 --> 00:49:06.547
Excuse me.

00:49:06.881 --> 00:49:10.118
I'm the kind of woman
who gets DMs from idols.

00:49:10.952 --> 00:49:13.121
So stop barking up the wrong tree...

00:49:13.121 --> 00:49:14.922
and go do your job.

00:49:21.296 --> 00:49:22.263
Impressive.

00:49:24.932 --> 00:49:27.302
I don't know what you do for a living,

00:49:27.302 --> 00:49:28.836
but threatening women like this...

00:49:28.836 --> 00:49:30.738
and extorting money from them...

00:49:42.116 --> 00:49:43.451
Amazing.

00:49:44.552 --> 00:49:46.220
A hundred ten thousand followers?

00:49:47.121 --> 00:49:48.156
You're one of the cool crowd.

00:49:50.024 --> 00:49:52.460
Luxury brands, hot restaurants,

00:49:52.460 --> 00:49:53.494
and overseas trips.

00:49:53.995 --> 00:49:54.996
I'm so jealous.

00:49:56.864 --> 00:49:58.666
You old creep.

00:49:58.666 --> 00:50:00.201
I'll check out your account too.

00:50:01.235 --> 00:50:02.670
But I won't send DMs.

00:50:03.504 --> 00:50:04.939
I'll leave photos in the comments.

00:50:05.273 --> 00:50:06.240
The sexy kind.

00:50:19.787 --> 00:50:21.356
Why did it take so long?

00:50:23.191 --> 00:50:25.793
(Transfer to An Woo Sik, 20,000 dollars)

00:50:27.228 --> 00:50:28.730
I sent it. Check.

00:50:29.831 --> 00:50:30.798
Are you happy...

00:50:30.798 --> 00:50:32.567
taking 50 percent off the top
every single time?

00:50:32.567 --> 00:50:34.002
Here we go again.

00:50:34.002 --> 00:50:35.670
I'm the one who brings in all the work.

00:50:35.670 --> 00:50:37.772
Isn't this too exploitative?

00:50:37.772 --> 00:50:40.642
You still have a long way to go
before that debt is paid off.

00:50:42.076 --> 00:50:43.311
I was crazy.

00:50:43.645 --> 00:50:45.546
How did I end up with a leech like you?

00:50:46.314 --> 00:50:49.117
I'm the reason
you're starting to act human again.

00:50:49.350 --> 00:50:50.652
If I'd just left you back then,

00:50:50.652 --> 00:50:53.187
you'd have had your limbs chopped off
and be begging somewhere.

00:50:53.187 --> 00:50:53.988
Hey.

00:50:54.322 --> 00:50:56.090
Why do you have to talk like such a jerk?

00:50:57.258 --> 00:50:58.226
What, a jerk?

00:50:59.227 --> 00:51:01.462
I save some worthless punk...

00:51:01.462 --> 00:51:02.697
drowning in gambling debt,

00:51:02.697 --> 00:51:03.931
and you're calling me a jerk?

00:51:03.931 --> 00:51:05.600
You got a problem with 50 percent?

00:51:05.600 --> 00:51:08.936
I helped you with your jobs,
got found out and lost my dealer job,

00:51:08.936 --> 00:51:10.838
and right before you got stabbed,
I paid money to stop it...

00:51:10.838 --> 00:51:12.307
and even saved your ass, so what?

00:51:12.941 --> 00:51:14.509
Now you're regretting the deal?

00:51:15.610 --> 00:51:17.245
I've got your bankbook and seal,

00:51:17.245 --> 00:51:20.515
and even the promissory note
you wrote that day.

00:51:21.049 --> 00:51:22.483
So go ahead and try something.

00:51:23.217 --> 00:51:25.586
If I sell you off
to loan sharks for extra cash,

00:51:25.586 --> 00:51:27.889
you'll be shipped
straight to a fishing boat galley.

00:51:27.889 --> 00:51:29.557
Whatever.

00:51:30.558 --> 00:51:31.859
You know my bad luck streak
is over now, right?

00:51:32.760 --> 00:51:35.296
(Ryu Jun Ho)

00:51:35.296 --> 00:51:37.098
Your bad luck may be over,

00:51:37.865 --> 00:51:40.201
but my luck's finally turning.

00:51:41.436 --> 00:51:42.270
What?

00:51:46.274 --> 00:51:47.609
The color turned out nice.

00:51:47.609 --> 00:51:48.643
But I guess I should cover it.

00:51:49.677 --> 00:51:50.645
What a waste.

00:51:58.286 --> 00:51:59.754
(When will my memory come back?)

00:51:59.754 --> 00:52:01.222
(Who was the person in my dream?)

00:52:01.222 --> 00:52:02.490
(Explosion?)

00:52:02.490 --> 00:52:04.225
(Why can't I remem...)

00:52:23.311 --> 00:52:24.579
Yesterday, in the woods,

00:52:25.913 --> 00:52:29.150
there was a boy who tried to steal my bag.

00:52:29.150 --> 00:52:30.385
Let go! Let go of my bag!

00:52:30.385 --> 00:52:31.152
You little...

00:52:34.455 --> 00:52:36.057
He lives around here.

00:52:37.725 --> 00:52:40.695
After fighting with him,
I ended up at the police station.

00:52:41.696 --> 00:52:42.830
His mother...

00:52:44.499 --> 00:52:46.934
spoke as if I'd killed someone,

00:52:50.038 --> 00:52:52.307
and everyone looked like..

00:52:54.809 --> 00:52:57.078
they already knew it was true.

00:52:58.212 --> 00:53:00.148
Why are you following someone
who killed a person?

00:53:00.148 --> 00:53:01.516
Do you want to get killed too?

00:53:05.720 --> 00:53:07.956
The detectives came today.

00:53:08.890 --> 00:53:11.326
They thought it was strange...

00:53:11.926 --> 00:53:13.394
that I still remember nothing.

00:53:15.530 --> 00:53:16.397
No.

00:53:17.398 --> 00:53:19.000
They were suspicious of me.

00:53:19.467 --> 00:53:22.670
Are you saying you still
don't remember the accident at all?

00:53:25.039 --> 00:53:27.442
They think the villa burned down
and someone died...

00:53:31.479 --> 00:53:33.715
because of me.

00:53:36.985 --> 00:53:39.721
Can you tell me why you think that?

00:53:40.254 --> 00:53:41.255
It's just...

00:53:42.957 --> 00:53:44.926
I feel like...

00:53:44.926 --> 00:53:46.995
I did something terribly wrong.

00:53:48.796 --> 00:53:50.865
No matter how I think about it,

00:53:52.600 --> 00:53:54.769
memory isn't what's tormenting me.

00:53:55.336 --> 00:53:57.505
Then what do you think it is?

00:53:57.872 --> 00:53:59.774
I think it's emotion.

00:54:02.243 --> 00:54:04.746
I keep seeing a woman burn to death,

00:54:05.280 --> 00:54:07.282
and the man who tried to kill me
in my dream...

00:54:07.282 --> 00:54:08.449
also feels so real,

00:54:10.785 --> 00:54:12.053
like I was there...

00:54:12.920 --> 00:54:14.722
with those people...

00:54:14.722 --> 00:54:16.391
in that place.

00:54:18.059 --> 00:54:19.627
Even after returning home...

00:54:19.627 --> 00:54:21.729
to live with the man I'm engaged to,

00:54:24.032 --> 00:54:25.600
I can't shake the feeling...

00:54:26.301 --> 00:54:27.835
that something is wrong.

00:54:28.469 --> 00:54:29.370
This...

00:54:30.338 --> 00:54:32.340
is a different problem from memory.

00:54:32.874 --> 00:54:34.876
It's okay. Go on.

00:54:39.080 --> 00:54:40.648
If I keep doing this counseling...

00:54:42.317 --> 00:54:44.552
and endure treatment,

00:54:47.422 --> 00:54:48.756
then someday,

00:54:50.525 --> 00:54:51.960
my memory will come back, right?

00:54:53.394 --> 00:54:54.429
Of course.

00:55:00.068 --> 00:55:01.002
Doctor.

00:55:07.408 --> 00:55:08.543
We're engaged.

00:55:09.110 --> 00:55:10.945
- Do you remember?
- I don't remember...

00:55:12.847 --> 00:55:14.015
anything.

00:55:16.884 --> 00:55:19.621
There's one thing
I've learned about myself.

00:55:19.621 --> 00:55:22.256
It feels more like emotion than memory.

00:55:22.590 --> 00:55:25.526
From the moment I woke up in the hospital,

00:55:27.562 --> 00:55:29.163
I wanted my memory to come back,

00:55:30.665 --> 00:55:32.667
but I've only grown more helpless.

00:55:35.570 --> 00:55:36.437
Our house.

00:55:38.106 --> 00:55:39.440
Our house.

00:55:40.875 --> 00:55:42.010
It's meaningless.

00:55:42.877 --> 00:55:44.379
This kind of waiting.

00:55:48.283 --> 00:55:49.284
I won't do it any longer.

00:55:51.486 --> 00:55:53.821
I'm done waiting for my memory.

00:56:30.437 --> 00:56:35.253
(REVERSE)

00:56:35.430 --> 00:56:36.431
Tell me clearly.

00:56:36.431 --> 00:56:38.099
Who exactly are they saying I killed?

00:56:38.333 --> 00:56:39.667
Did you ever imagine...

00:56:39.667 --> 00:56:42.303
someone could commit murder
in that blazing inferno?

00:56:42.303 --> 00:56:43.671
But you seemed very close.

00:56:43.671 --> 00:56:45.273
You're talking about Hee Su, right?

00:56:45.273 --> 00:56:46.841
I want to know who she is.

00:56:46.841 --> 00:56:49.477
I don't think
she was that important a friend.

00:56:49.477 --> 00:56:50.612
Ms. Ham.

00:56:50.612 --> 00:56:53.114
Isn't she worse off than what you told me?

00:56:53.114 --> 00:56:54.916
That's why it's dangerous.

00:56:54.916 --> 00:56:55.783
Blackmail?

00:56:55.783 --> 00:56:57.885
This is the person you hired.

00:56:57.885 --> 00:57:00.655
Myo Jin is acting out of character.

00:57:00.655 --> 00:57:02.256
You need to bleed too.

00:57:03.478 --> 00:57:05.478
(Subtitles are provided by KOCOWA.)